  "instructions": [
    "Marinate tofu in a mixture of Malaysian chili sauce, lime juice, and soy sauce for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Heat a grill or grill pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Thread marinated tofu and vegetables onto skewers.",
    "Brush coconut oil onto the tofu and vegetables.",
    "Grill for 8-10 minutes, or until tofu and vegetables are cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, mix together chopped peanuts, cilantro, and sugar in a small bowl.",
    "Once tofu and vegetables are cooked, brush with Worcestershire sauce and Nam pla.",
    "Serve skewers with peanut-cilantro mixture on top and a side of lime wedges.",
    "Garnish with additional cilantro and peanuts if desired."
  ],
